    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/62637fe22d6f4447f1e521c88ad9e17f.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" width=600 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/62637fe22d6f4447f1e521c88ad9e17f.webm?t=1754330359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARTIUS: Pure Imagination</strong> is a fast-paced, momentum-driven platformer all about movement, creativity, and expression. Play as four unique artists, each with their own abilities, and fight to preserve creativity in a world on the brink of artistic extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b0013eba5a56552733065c7621bbbb66.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b0013eba5a56552733065c7621bbbb66.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is losing its spark. Inspiration is fading. The forces of uniformity are closing in. But ART will not go quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/6d082ab91c4bc81361b3fb0197c6f672.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/6d082ab91c4bc81361b3fb0197c6f672.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s where you come in. Take control of Pierre, Ren\u00e9, Walter and Guga\u2014each representing a different artistic discipline\u2014and use their unique talents to restore color, music, and imagination to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/fccc47c131a49912e5c75f0907735569.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/fccc47c131a49912e5c75f0907735569.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a mix of high-speed platforming, stylish moves, and expressive gameplay, <strong>ARTIUS</strong> lets you <strong>dash, paint, sculpt, compose, and create</strong> your way through dynamic hand-drawn worlds inspired by the very essence of art itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b7e03f05d3aa105b35d73ce9720f3a8.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b7e03f05d3aa105b35d73ce9720f3a8.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUN, JUMP &amp; EXPRESS YOURSELF in a momentum-driven platformer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSE YOURSELF in vibrant, hand-crafted worlds inspired by different art forms!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER the unique abilities of four distinct artists!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE OFF against surreal foes trying to erase creativity from existence!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER a cozy, creative hub world brimming with secrets and inspiration!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/7088168b909bc5735b4fa13a104c2f27.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/7088168b909bc5735b4fa13a104c2f27.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONLY YOU CAN STOP THE ARTISTIC EXTINCTION.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/62637fe22d6f4447f1e521c88ad9e17f.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" width=600 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/62637fe22d6f4447f1e521c88ad9e17f.webm?t=1754330359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARTIUS: Pure Imagination</strong> is a fast-paced, momentum-driven platformer all about movement, creativity, and expression. Play as four unique artists, each with their own abilities, and fight to preserve creativity in a world on the brink of artistic extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b0013eba5a56552733065c7621bbbb66.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/b0013eba5a56552733065c7621bbbb66.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is losing its spark. Inspiration is fading. The forces of uniformity are closing in. But ART will not go quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/6d082ab91c4bc81361b3fb0197c6f672.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/6d082ab91c4bc81361b3fb0197c6f672.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s where you come in. Take control of Pierre, Ren\u00e9, Walter and Guga\u2014each representing a different artistic discipline\u2014and use their unique talents to restore color, music, and imagination to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/fccc47c131a49912e5c75f0907735569.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/fccc47c131a49912e5c75f0907735569.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a mix of high-speed platforming, stylish moves, and expressive gameplay, <strong>ARTIUS</strong> lets you <strong>dash, paint, sculpt, compose, and create</strong> your way through dynamic hand-drawn worlds inspired by the very essence of art itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b7e03f05d3aa105b35d73ce9720f3a8.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/8b7e03f05d3aa105b35d73ce9720f3a8.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUN, JUMP &amp; EXPRESS YOURSELF in a momentum-driven platformer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSE YOURSELF in vibrant, hand-crafted worlds inspired by different art forms!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER the unique abilities of four distinct artists!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE OFF against surreal foes trying to erase creativity from existence!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER a cozy, creative hub world brimming with secrets and inspiration!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/7088168b909bc5735b4fa13a104c2f27.poster.avif?t=1754330359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/7088168b909bc5735b4fa13a104c2f27.gif?t=1754330359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONLY YOU CAN STOP THE ARTISTIC EXTINCTION.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "ARTIUS is a fast-paced, momentum-based 2D platformer where you play as four unique artists fighting to preserve creativity in a world on the verge of artistic extinction. Dash, swing, and smash your way through vibrant, hand-drawn worlds inspired by art!",
